\par \hich\af180\dbch\af31505\loch\f180 Broken and dead of their burdens and sores,
\par \hich\af180\dbch\af31505\loch\f180 He, for a change, shall remember He made them \hich\f180 \endash 
\par \hich\af180\dbch\af31505\loch\f180 One of the best of His numerous chores \hich\f180 \endash 
\par 
\par \hich\af180\dbch\af31505\loch\f180 Order from some one a sigh of repentance \hich\f180 \endash 
\par \hich\af180\dbch\af31505\loch\f180 Donkeys of Araby, Syria, Greece \hich\f180 \endash 
\par \hich\af180\dbch\af31505\loch\f180 Over the fondouk distemper the sentence:
\par \loch\af180\dbch\af31505\hich\f180 \'ab\loch\f180 God\loch\af180\dbch\af31505\hich\f180 \rquote \loch\f180 s own forsaken \hich\f180 \endash \loch\f180 \hich\f180  the stable of peace\'bb.
\par 
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa240\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11231141 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1049\langfe1049\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1049\langfenp1049 {\rtlch\fcs1 
